From 4a40729f970ace12e3075c328031cafa541de900 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Bitzek <e.bitzek@mpie.de>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 18:49:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] fix mc/sites + sites/voronoi: uniformity by
 construction, non-periodic face ownership, restart RNG independence

Fixes for the 2026-08-28 production aborts (sum of nlocal != natoms,
natoms high by 1 and by 3, discharge leg, 1024 ranks) and for the latent
defects found in the same audit (AUDIT-2026-08-29.md in the project
repo). Honest status: the confirmed-and-demonstrated mechanism is the
divergence CASCADE -- one rank-divergent Metropolis input desynchronizes
natoms/energy_stored and reproduces the campaign signature exactly
(deterministic np=2 injection, seeds recorded in tests/PROGRESS) -- while
the campaign's root trigger (a cross-rank-non-identical energy reduction
at 1024 ranks) could not be proven from this machine. The fix removes
the entire input-divergence class by construction, so it holds whether
or not that trigger is confirmed; the Phase-A assertions name any other
mechanism at the trial where it occurs on the resumed run.

- energy_full(): result broadcast from rank 0 (one scalar bcast per
  evaluation). mu/temp equal-style variables: evaluated per rank as
  before, then rank 0's values broadcast per block; the temp validity
  check now tests the broadcast value (was the one genuinely
  rank-divergent error predicate in the fix).
- non-periodic box faces: compute sites/voronoi clamps fp-scale face
  over/undershoot onto the face and the global-high-face rank's
  emission window now covers [subhi - nudge, boxhi] (no wrapped partner
  image exists in a non-periodic dim); fix mc/sites' site_owner_flag
  clamps face noise within 1e-6*prd (one ulp inside at the high face);
  build_catalog validates every empty entry and drops sites no rank
  owns identically on all ranks (one-shot warning) -- policy rationale
  in QUESTIONS.md Q12.
- restart(): random_unequal re-derives a distinct per-rank stream from
  the saved rank-0 state (restart format unchanged; v1.1 collapsed all
  ranks onto rank 0's stream after any resume, defeating patch 0005).
- run_source_mode(): hard error replaces the catalog[-1] out-of-bounds
  read if the empty-entry scan ever fails.
- doc/src/fix_mc_sites.rst: check-mode diagnostics, face/drop behavior,
  restart RNG semantics.

Suite: 50/50 on build/lmp (44 existing + 6 new in project
tests/test_8_11_natoms_bookkeeping.py: face-noise clamp, outside-drop,
perturbation-vs-broadcast, mu-ramp uniformity at np=4, genuine-loss
attribution, restart round trip).
